Feature: FRANK Platform Threat Intelligence API # features/frank_api.feature:1
  As a cybersecurity professional
  I want to submit and query threat intelligence
  So that I can contribute to and benefit from collective defense
  Feature: FRANK Platform Threat Intelligence API  # features/frank_api.feature:1

  Scenario Outline: Submit threat intelligence with different access levels -- @1.1   # features/frank_api.feature:18
    Given the FRANK API is running                                                    # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:44
    And the database is initialized with demo data                                    # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:53
    Given I am authenticated as a partner user                                        # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:62
    When I submit a threat intelligence sighting with confidence 85                   # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:109
    Then the submission should be accepted                                            # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:188
    And my contribution score should increase by 10-25                                # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:198

