  Scenario: Observer cannot submit threat intelligence               # features/frank_api.feature:22
    Given the FRANK API is running                                   # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:44
    And the database is initialized with demo data                   # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:53
    Given I am authenticated as an observer user                     # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:62
