  Scenario: Search with confidence filtering                 # features/frank_api.feature:49
    Given the FRANK API is running                           # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:44
    And the database is initialized with demo data           # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:53
    Given I am authenticated as a contributor user           # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:62
    And there are sightings with various confidence levels   # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:84
    When I query for sightings with minimum confidence 80    # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:127
    Then all returned sightings should have confidence >= 80 # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:261
    And the results should be properly paginated             # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:270

  Scenario: Invalid query parameters are rejected                       # features/frank_api.feature:56
    Given the FRANK API is running                                      # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:44
