    Given I am authenticated as an observer user                 # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:62
    When I make more than 500 requests in a day                  # features/steps/frank_api.steps.py:142
    Then subsequent requests should be rejected with "429" error # None
    And the error message should contain "Rate limit exceeded"   # None

